        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I only have Horizons of Spirit Island, just bought it yesterday.  I got an email advertising the Spirit Island Classic Panel Boards, but it is confusing not already knowing about the game. A couple of questions:\n\n- Does this add any content to Horizons of Spirit Island?\n- Is this just a materials issue, and only really interesting to Spirit Island owners who are putting HoSI materials into their SI games?\n- Shipping is more than the cost of this product, is it possible it will be availalbe in retail stores or at conventions?\n\nThanks",
